<rml>
<head>
    <title>Offline match rules</title>
    <link type="text/template" href="../../components/dialog.rml" />
    <link type="text/rcss" href="offline.rcss" />
</head>
<body template="prime-dialog">
    <div class="offline_dialog">
        <h1>MATCH RULES</h1>
        <p>Apply saves the rules for future local matches. Cancel discards this draft.</p>
        <div class="offline_rule_columns">
            <div class="offline_panel">
                <div id="offline_point_goal_row" class="offline_field" data-prime-visible="offline_point_goal_visible"><label for="offline_point_goal">Point goal (0–999)</label><input id="offline_point_goal" type="text" maxlength="3" /></div>
                <div id="offline_time_limit_row" class="offline_field" data-prime-visible="offline_time_limit_visible"><label for="offline_time_limit">Time limit (m:ss)</label><input id="offline_time_limit" type="text" maxlength="5" /></div>
                <div id="offline_time_goal_row" class="offline_field" data-prime-visible="offline_time_goal_visible"><label for="offline_time_goal">Time goal (m:ss)</label><input id="offline_time_goal" type="text" maxlength="5" /></div>
                <div id="offline_chamber_help" data-prime-visible="offline_chamber_help_visible">3 lives // Last player standing. One lethal shot. Kills earn ammo.</div>
                <button id="offline_damage_value" class="offline_action" data-action="offline:damage" data-prime-text="{{offline_damage_value}}" />
            </div>
            <div class="offline_panel">
                <button id="offline_rule_1" class="offline_action" data-action="offline:rule:1" data-prime-text="{{offline_rule1_label}}" data-prime-visible="offline_fire_visible" />
                <button id="offline_rule_2" class="offline_action" data-action="offline:rule:2" data-prime-text="{{offline_rule2_label}}" />
                <button id="offline_rule_3" class="offline_action" data-action="offline:rule:3" data-prime-text="{{offline_rule3_label}}" />
                <button id="offline_rule_4" class="offline_action" data-action="offline:rule:4" data-prime-text="{{offline_rule4_label}}" />
                <button id="offline_rule_11" class="offline_action" data-action="offline:rule:11" data-prime-text="{{offline_rule11_label}}" />
                <button id="offline_rule_12" class="offline_action" data-action="offline:rule:12" data-prime-text="{{offline_rule12_label}}" />
                <button id="offline_rule_13" class="offline_action" data-action="offline:rule:13" data-prime-text="{{offline_rule13_label}}" data-prime-visible="offline_movement_visible" />
                <p id="offline_movement_help" data-prime-visible="offline_movement_visible">Momentum: air-strafing and bunny-hop momentum. Alternate-form abilities stay native.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="offline_panel">
                <button id="offline_rule_10" class="offline_action" data-action="offline:rule:10" data-prime-text="{{offline_rule10_label}}" />
                <button id="offline_rule_6" class="offline_action" data-action="offline:rule:6" data-prime-text="{{offline_rule6_label}}" />
                <button id="offline_rule_7" class="offline_action" data-action="offline:rule:7" data-prime-text="{{offline_rule7_label}}" />
                <button id="offline_rule_8" class="offline_action" data-action="offline:rule:8" data-prime-text="{{offline_rule8_label}}" />
                <button id="offline_rule_9" class="offline_action" data-action="offline:rule:9" data-prime-text="{{offline_rule9_label}}" />
                <button id="offline_rule_0" class="offline_action" data-action="offline:rule:0" data-prime-text="{{offline_rule0_label}}" data-prime-visible="offline_auto_reset_visible" />
                <button id="offline_rule_14" class="offline_action" data-action="offline:rule:14" data-prime-text="{{offline_rule14_label}}" />
                <p>Riftline M7: Battle (free-for-all) only. Native weapon selected at spawn. Replay recording and killcams unavailable.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div id="offline_rules_error" class="offline_error" data-prime-text="{{offline_rules_error}}" />
        <div class="offline_actions"><button id="offline_rules_cancel" data-action="offline:cancel-rules" class="offline_action">CANCEL</button><button id="offline_rules_apply" data-action="offline:apply-rules" class="offline_action primary">APPLY RULES</button></div>
    </div>
</body>
</rml>
